<myopenmath xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" id="122183">
<statement>
<p>
Suppose that A is the set of all numbers divisible by 5 and B is the set of all numbers divisible by 10. Label each of the following as true or false.
</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{A}\subseteq{B}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>true</li> 
<li>false</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{B}\subseteq{A}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>true</li> 
<li>false</li> 
</ol></p>

</statement>
<solution>
<p><ul><li>B: false</li><li>A: true</li></ul></p>
</solution>
</myopenmath>

